- **Breaking change:** Manual labels no longer match hosts by `hostname`. In GitOps and `fleetctl apply`, a label's `hosts` match `hardware_serial`, `uuid`, or `id`. In `POST /api/v1/fleet/labels` and `PATCH /api/v1/fleet/labels/:id`, `hosts` match `hardware_serial` or `uuid` (or use `host_ids`), and no longer match the undocumented node key and osquery host ID either. An identifier that isn't one of these now matches no host.
